\title{Force-directed graph (inline d3)}
\import{base-macros}

\p{A live d3 force simulation rendered inline, the code in
\code{figures/force-graph.ts}. The layout animates as it settles, and each node
is draggable — release to let it snap back into the simulation.}

\d3{force-graph}

\p{The figure returns a teardown (\code{simulation.stop()}) so toggling the
theme or resizing re-renders cleanly without leaving the old simulation
running. Try the theme switch in the top-right.}
